@prefix TS28532_FileDataReportingMnS: <http://ericsson.com/models/3gpp/TS28532/FileDataReportingMnS#> .
@prefix TS28532_FileDataReportingMnS_FileInfo: <http://ericsson.com/models/3gpp/TS28532/FileDataReportingMnS/FileInfo#> .
